{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-17084", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-17084", "text": "'Looks the pack up online. Asks first'", "sha256": "412a5cfa09db195a40f39aca26555d3002b1a11c07c3339f125d64252b225172", "kind": "dart", "start": 17084, "end": 17122, "line": 447}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-17398", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-17398", "text": "'Looking it up'", "sha256": "d21a8ab89ef0a42e6353c361ee93cd69553ce101cacd745f8bde15720ea27699", "kind": "dart", "start": 17398, "end": 17413, "line": 455}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-17482", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-17482", "text": "'The boxes fill as soon as the answer is here.'", "sha256": "fe9ae954e982b2ec17ac1941fbc58d6e6e985ae652a797656236d9bac29483a7", "kind": "dart", "start": 17482, "end": 17529, "line": 457}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-17960", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-17960", "text": "'Chicken and rice'", "sha256": "77387dc9114d7e76b39fa8f56dc116e845813b416beaeb9afe332aaebdd4d0b1", "kind": "dart", "start": 17960, "end": 17978, "line": 468}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-19593", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-19593", "text": "'A blank number stays blank. Only \"What\" is needed.'", "sha256": "4b97c97e28102aade6cfd04f70412f06629f0b8585e243e718afb13beae053d0", "kind": "dart", "start": 19593, "end": 19645, "line": 508}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-20765", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-20765", "text": "'Say what it was first.'", "sha256": "fe1802bd8347d997aafde99386c88cb3ccbbc2798f6e59d30ae2dd6808405c84", "kind": "dart", "start": 20765, "end": 20789, "line": 531}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-23868", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-23868", "text": "'Look barcodes up online?'", "sha256": "f56b1a6ac902b2b8d3ba0b0db4c07d698b1804c73a565838ca12304075b884e2", "kind": "dart", "start": 23868, "end": 23894, "line": 617}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-24087", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-24087", "text": "'A scan sends the barcode to openfoodfacts.org, a free, '\n'open food database. They see the barcode and your IP '\n'address. Nothing about you, your meals or your health '\n'leaves this phone, and a barcode you have scanned before '\n'is answered from your own copy without asking them again.'", "sha256": "8a6344b335601aa6008462f9967dbe0490dbe1e1ec9b0a036636e36cd4d60d33", "kind": "dart", "start": 24087, "end": 24481, "line": 622}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-24706", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-24706", "text": "'Their numbers are typed in by the public and a fair few of '\n'them are wrong, so anything that fails a sanity check is '\n'left blank rather than filled in. Everything it does fill '\n'in is yours to edit before you save.'", "sha256": "e8b86f5f6e99eb75e0a82217f91729affa50b15cecbb310c738162a729b64d45", "kind": "dart", "start": 24706, "end": 25005, "line": 632}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-25230", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-25230", "text": "'You can turn this back off in Settings › Privacy. Typing '\n'the numbers off the pack works either way.'", "sha256": "54dcced08ac24ee868f7db27df38af611612b2e30ee1213ae96ae8e77aa56637", "kind": "dart", "start": 25230, "end": 25360, "line": 641}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-25549", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-25549", "text": "'Allow lookups'", "sha256": "6d2dc48898d0b01861c9040eeb1c51deeff9effc2c5c4618126b59303c3d434d", "kind": "dart", "start": 25549, "end": 25564, "line": 646}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart:offset-25737", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_food.dart", "location": "offset-25737", "text": "'Not now'", "sha256": "64ff87ca04a499edac19e43adfab17e1e337d3fd7c1eec931bebcc8894f23d29", "kind": "dart", "start": 25737, "end": 25746, "line": 649}
