{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart:offset-11330", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart", "location": "offset-11330", "text": "'This one may already have been logged or dismissed.'", "sha256": "a33c3ea511627b330f533102b96dfdf5bc98f03421b35ce46bbea9f715b0e72d", "kind": "dart", "start": 11330, "end": 11383, "line": 283}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart:offset-12025", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart", "location": "offset-12025", "text": "'These are the hard minutes, not the whole session'", "sha256": "6ce76691a3e7f25540a3db59f6e089fadea822505a032ec01f60536b84489c95", "kind": "dart", "start": 12025, "end": 12076, "line": 299}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart:offset-12150", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart", "location": "offset-12150", "text": "'Detection reports the sustained effort it could see, so a '\n'warm-up and the rest between sets fall outside it. '\n'Adjust the times before logging if the window is short.'", "sha256": "ae84474ef33c2a27518b92e5dba836ed5056232455bade5d798a22e76b94ab37", "kind": "dart", "start": 12150, "end": 12374, "line": 301}
