{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart:offset-23289", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart", "location": "offset-23289", "text": "'Saved. No heart rate was recorded over that window, so it '\n'has no strain and no calorie figure — the times are all this '\n'one carries.'", "sha256": "931a2e306c53a8ef840a6aa89212f8a01c0be2f6fce64e636492b227af61c532", "kind": "dart", "start": 23289, "end": 23464, "line": 603}
